  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to Norwegian Refugee Council</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Norwegian Refugee Council</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det till Norwegian Refugee Council (NRC) avser finansiera organisationens projekt som syftar till att etablera en mer inkluderande humanit&#xe4;r finansieringsmodell genom att engagera nya givare (Non Traditional Contributors, NTC:er). M&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningen med st&#xf6;det &#xe4;r att skapa b&#xe4;ttre f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r en ut&#xf6;kad humanit&#xe4;r givarbas till f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;n f&#xf6;r insatser som r&#xe4;ddar liv och lindrar n&#xf6;d i de mest utsatta humanit&#xe4;ra kriserna globalt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support to the Norwegian Refugee Council (NRC) is intended to fund the organization&apos;s project that aim to establish a more inclusive humanitarian financing model by engaging new donors (Non Traditional Contributors, NTCs). The objective is to create better conditions for an expanded humanitarian donor base in favour of efforts that save lives and alleviate suffering in the most vulnerable humanitarian crises globally.</narrative>
  </description>
